# Every component's Dockerfile uses build context "." (repo root) so it can
# COPY files from other component directories (e.g. hub/Dockerfile stages
# from /src/hub). Without this file the whole repo tree — including
# multi-gigabyte local-only directories never meant to reach an image — gets
# sent to the Docker daemon as build context on every build.
.git
.claude
.idea
.trunk
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/*.test
ui/.next
ui/out
